      <memberdef kind="function" id="reduction__table_8h_1a0288903fa1ed8f1b1d838e26e748d15b" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type><ref refid="semantic__types_8h_1a6ea4594c8b87bee8d9d968786952c01c" kindref="member">PrecedenceSemanticAction</ref></type>
        <definition>PrecedenceSemanticAction reduction_table_lookup</definition>
        <argsstring>(const SearchHandle *handle, int line)</argsstring>
        <name>reduction_table_lookup</name>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="structSearchHandle" kindref="compound">SearchHandle</ref> *</type>
          <declname>handle</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>int</type>
          <declname>line</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Vyhleda v redukcni tabulce pravidlo podle handle. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Tabulka je serazena podle delky handle, funkce proto preskoci kratsi handle, porovna cely vyhledavany handle (delku i vsechny symboly) postupne se vsemi handle stejne delky a pri prvnim delsim handle vyhledavani konci. Delka vyhledavaneho handle musi byt v rozsahu 1 az HANDLE_MAX_LENGTH, jinak jde o internich chybu (ERR_INTERNAL). Pokud pravidlo neexistuje, program skonci syntaktickou chybou (ERR_SYNTAX) a na stderr vypise hledany handle.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>handle</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Vyhledavany handle, sestaveny jadrem ze symbolu zasobniku v prirozenem poradi (viz <ref refid="structSearchHandle" kindref="compound">SearchHandle</ref>), nesmi byt NULL. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>line</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Cislo radku vstupniho tokenu pro chybova hlaseni. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Semanticka akce nalezeneho pravidla, nikdy NULL. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
